WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.225 --> 00:00:05.560
(Madelyn)
Listen, I’m going to be late.

00:00:05.643 --> 00:00:07.061
(Madelyn)
They’ve put me on another flight.

00:00:08.563 --> 00:00:09.147
(Ali)
I love you baby.

00:00:09.814 --> 00:00:10.523
[boom]

00:00:11.899 --> 00:00:12.859
(Howard)
There’s been an incident,

00:00:12.859 --> 00:00:15.111
(Howard)
A 950 has disappeared over the Atlantic.

00:00:15.111 --> 00:00:16.529
[explosion]
[screaming]

00:00:16.654 --> 00:00:17.447
(Kendra)
I’m sorry Howard...

00:00:17.447 --> 00:00:18.072
(Howard)
I need you.

00:00:18.531 --> 00:00:20.491
(Howard)
You’re the only one who can find this plane.

00:00:20.491 --> 00:00:21.117
[boom]
[screaming]

00:00:22.243 --> 00:00:24.120
(Dom)
It is strange there was no Mayday of any kind.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.163
(Levi)
It could have been a highjacking.

00:00:25.496 --> 00:00:26.164
[boom]

00:00:26.164 --> 00:00:26.831
[explosion]

00:00:26.831 --> 00:00:28.875
(Kendra)
Somebody onbaord wanted that aircraft to disappear.

00:00:30.668 --> 00:00:31.461
(Dom)
They found debris.

00:00:31.461 --> 00:00:32.045
(Kendra)
No.

00:00:32.253 --> 00:00:32.962
(Kendra)
A survivor.

00:00:32.962 --> 00:00:33.963
[helicoptor]

00:00:35.131 --> 00:00:37.300
(Kendra)
Is our miracle survivor our prime suspect?

00:00:38.426 --> 00:00:39.385
(Ali)
Is this an interrogation?

00:00:39.552 --> 00:00:40.345
(Ali)
What are you accusing me of?

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:41.638
(Kendra)
It wasn’t an accident.

00:00:42.388 --> 00:00:43.556
(Dom)
Terrorist causes crash.

00:00:43.556 --> 00:00:44.641
(Kendra)
Could look like an act of war.

00:00:44.974 --> 00:00:45.975
(Dom)
A van’s following us.

00:00:46.976 --> 00:00:48.519
(Kendra)
People went to great lengths to cover up 

00:00:48.519 --> 00:00:50.355
(Kendra)
what crashed flight 716.

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:52.607
(Kendra)
I go where the evidence takes me.

00:00:53.232 --> 00:00:54.108
(Howard)
It’s not possible.

00:00:54.901 --> 00:00:56.319
(Kendra)
We need to hear what happened on that flight,

00:00:56.319 --> 00:00:57.487
(Kendra)
we need to know the truth.

